flowchart TD
    P["1. YOU TYPE ONE PROMPT IN NORMAL CLAUDE<br/>Question • idea • code mission • research • life • revenue"]
    P --> U["UBERMIND Ω⁵ PROMPT-FIRST DIRECTOR<br/>One lead conversation, not a permanent swarm"]
    U --> A{"Is source material / repository accessible IN THIS SESSION?"}
    A -- "Yes" --> R["RECOVER JUST ENOUGH CONTEXT<br/>AI_START_HERE • AGENTS • current PHOENIX<br/>Relevant #0001–#0890 idea IDs • current task files"]
    A -- "No" --> K["USE ATTACHED MATERIAL + STATED FACTS<br/>Do not claim unseen repo or account access"]
    R --> C["TASK CONTRACT IN ONE PASS<br/>Definition of done • quality floor • deadline • permissions"]
    K --> C
    C --> E{"ACCEPTED EXACT RESULT ALREADY APPLIES?"}
    E -- "Yes + genuine proof" --> Z["0 NEW MODEL CALLS<br/>Verified code • source lookup • existing accepted result"]
    E -- "No / applicability unknown" --> J{"BOUNDED TYPED REFLEX VALUABLE?"}
    J -- "Yes AND separate authorization" --> JV["JEV 1.13<br/>NOUL • CHOICE • SCORE<br/>Existing governed tensor + cache + single-flight"]
    J -- "No / strict $20 only" --> D["DETERMINISTIC LOCAL DISPATCH<br/>No fake JEV call"]
    JV --> F{"JEV result is sufficient under independent policy?"}
    F -- "Yes, certified scope" --> Z
    F -- "No / high-stakes / novel" --> D
    D --> N{"WHAT LEVEL OF INTELLIGENCE DOES THE PROMPT REQUIRE?"}
    N -- "Routine and well specified" --> S["SONNET 5.5 FOCUSED EXECUTION<br/>One Claude session, no teammates by default"]
    N -- "Novel / difficult / architecture" --> O["OPUS 5.5 FRONTIER PLANNING<br/>One deep plan + acceptance contract"]
    N -- "Unknown source facts" --> H["SHORT SCOUT: LOCAL SEARCH OR HAIKU<br/>Only if actually supported and worth quota"]
    O --> W{"WHERE ARE YOU USING CLAUDE?"}
    W -- "CLAUDE CODE" --> SWITCH["IF AVAILABLE: /model opusplan<br/>Opus plan → Sonnet implementation<br/>Use /status to check remaining allowance"]
    W -- "NORMAL CLAUDE CHAT" --> CHAT["KEEP ONE CONVERSATION<br/>Use Opus for difficult reasoning if available;<br/>continue without imaginary model switching"]
    SWITCH --> T{"REAL INDEPENDENT WORK WORTH EXTRA USAGE?"}
    CHAT --> T
    H --> T
    T -- "No (default)" --> SOLO["ONE WORKING AGENT<br/>Small diffs / targeted tools / concise receipts"]
    T -- "Yes, supported & authorized" --> TEAM["BOUNDED TEAM, NOT ALWAYS-ON<br/>Sonnet builder • independent tester<br/>Haiku scout only if available<br/>Owned tasks, no file conflicts"]
    S --> SOLO
    TEAM --> Q["INTEGRATE ONLY DELTA CONTEXT<br/>Facts • changes • failing tests • unresolved claims"]
    SOLO --> Q
    Q --> V{"DOES OUTPUT MEET QUALITY & RISK CONTRACT?"}
    V -- "Yes" --> DONE["RETURN ACCEPTED ANSWER / ARTIFACT<br/>Or authorized PR, merge and live proof"]
    V -- "No: genuine hard problem" --> FRONTIER["ESCALATE THE RESIDUAL ONLY<br/>Opus deep review or qualified independent Crown<br/>Never drop quality solely for price"]
    FRONTIER --> V
    DONE --> L["PHOENIX CONTINUATION RECEIPT<br/>Task, SHA, source, tests, errors,<br/>new exact certificates, relevant 890 idea IDs"]
    L -. "Next prompt reuses verified result" .-> E
    L -. "New GENESIS possibilities and capabilities" .-> R
    STOP["CLAUDE PRO $20 FIXED<br/>Shared five-hour + weekly allowance<br/>No Claude API credits, no hidden PAYG fallback"]
    STOP -. "Quota and provider authority gate" .-> U
    OTHER["Sol • Astra • Gemini • DeepSeek • GLM • Qwen • MiMo<br/>Only through their own authorized connectors/plans"] -. "Not paid by Claude Pro" .-> FRONTIER
    subgraph NORTH["SOVEREIGN INTELLIGENCE CONTEXT: not reloaded wholesale"]
       GENOME["890 ORIGINAL IDEAS + GENESIS"]
       BRAIN["TOTAL BRAIN / PHOENIX / NEGATIVE KNOWLEDGE"]
       CAP["CAPABILITY GENOME / REALITY COURT"]
    end
    GENOME -. "relevant IDs" .-> R
    BRAIN -. "verified pointers" .-> R
    CAP -. "approved tools + tests" .-> R
